        "sid": "ECC 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkagaruka nayetegereza, byona ebinyakukorwa kunionioza abantu omunsi. Nkarora amaziga g'abantu abarukusaalizibwa. Kandi bakaba bataina muntu ow'okubahuumuza! Abo abakaba nibabasaaliza, nubo bakaba baina obusobozi, banu bakaba bataina muntu ow'okubahuumuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nkateekereza nti, abafu abaafiire ira, baina omugisa okukira aboomeezi abatakafiire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu ow'arukubakira bombi, nuwe ogu ow'atakabahoga, kandi ow'atakaroraga ebikorwa ebibi, ebinyakukorwa omunsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, nkeetegereza omulimo gwona, n'okwekambira omulimo bireetwa ihali omuntu eri agirra mutaahi we. Eki nakyo, tikiina mugaso, kandi kiri nk'okubinga omuyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omudoma atera engaro ze ayeretera enjara kumwita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekihi kimu eky'obusinge, kirungi okukira ebihi bibiri eby'okutalibanira, nkaabinga omuyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omunsi nkagaruka narora ekitaina mugaso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu ataina muntu n'omu, taina mwana, rundi owanyina, baitu nabwo, tarukulekerra kutalibana, kandi amaiso ge, tiganiha eby'obuguuda, nukwo kuteekaguza omurundi na gumu ati, “N'oha ou ndukutalibanira nti, nkeebuza okusemererwa?” Eki nakyo, tikiina mugaso, kandi kintu ky'obujune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu ababiri, bakira omu, habwokuba, omulimo ogu batalibanira, bagutungamu empeera nungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, omu hali bo kakuba agwa, omu aimukya mutaahi we; baitu omuntu anyakwikara wenka, ow'aligwa akaburwa ow'okumwimukya, alikibona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekindi, abantu babiri kakuba babyama hamu, batagata; baitu omu anyakuli wenka, asobora ata kutagata? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu noobu araaba naasobora kusingura omuntu omu anyakuli wenka, ababiri bamusingura. Omuguha ogw'enyabusatu, tigucweka bwango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omusigazi omunaku kandi ow'amagezi, noobu aliba yarugire omu nkomo yateera engoma, rundi yagenda omu bukama bwe bwonyini, noobu aliba yazairwe ali munaku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naakira omukama omugurusi, kandi omudoma, atakyaikiriza kuhaburwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarora abantu boona aboomeezi, abanyakugendagenda omunsi, n'omusigazi ogu ow'akaba naija kwemerra omu kiikaro kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhendo gw'abantu boona ab'arukulema, gukaba gutarukubarwa, kandi abo abalimukurata, tibalimusiima; habw'ebi ebi yakozire, mazimakwo eki nakyo tikiina mugaso, kandi kiri nk'okubinga omuyaga kwonka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
